      {
        "id": 115226,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-24T05:58:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Related question: Can you pick up the Cloaking Device during the Power Up phase <em>BEFORE</em> following the Power Up instructions on the Cloaking Device, effectively remaining cloaked for another round?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>To expand on what Donner said: you cant put down a power you have picked up in the same turn. So the same turn you pick up Cloaking Device you can't put it back down. You can't chain Cloakings this way</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:20.554Z",
