        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n\nRelated question: Can you pick up the Cloaking Device during the Power Up phase _BEFORE_ following the Power Up instructions on the Cloaking Device, effectively remaining cloaked for another round?\n\n[/quote]\n\nTo expand on what Donner said: you cant put down a power you have picked up in the same turn. So the same turn you pick up Cloaking Device you can&#39;t put it back down. You can&#39;t chain Cloakings this way\n",
        "actions_summary": [],
